    Add the pgtable_pmd_page_ctor/pgtable_pmd_page_dtor calls to the pmd
    allocation and free functions and enable ARCH_ENABLE_SPLIT_PMD_PTLOCK
    for 64 bit.

    Signed-off-by: Martin Schwidefsky <schwidefsky@de.ibm.com>

